LAW 8 — TITLE AND LOCAL REFERENCES
======================================================================

The title is part of the source because paragraph text may begin with:

"He..."
"She..."
"It..."
"They..."
"The company..."
"The album..."
"The organization..."

Use the title only when it contributes to resolving the local subject or
object.

Example:

Title:
